Leaf/group rename, notify, delete and add-single-feed already work via the
native folder long-press menu — but two real gaps remained:

1. Rename didn't STICK: ensureLeafFolder/ensureGroupFolder overwrote folder
   .display from the server title on every channels.json re-sync. Now display
   is set ONCE at creation and never re-written, so a user rename (Edit
   properties → Display) survives.
2. Group folders (Cloud-Infra, CICD, …) are non-selectable → the selectable
   block never offered Edit properties, so they couldn't be renamed at all.
   Offer title_edit_properties for RSS group folders (opens FragmentFolder).
3. Per-feed poll interval was ignored (WorkerFeedSync fixed 6h). Now honors
   folder.poll_factor: effective interval = 6h * factor, gated on last_sync,
   so noisy channels can be slowed via Edit properties → poll factor.

Tester test-feed-management.sh 8/8.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
